{"3669790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speedrun Simulator", "steam_appid": 3669790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669790/extras/b0cd7dc7c062b405a3d331c57cd64df1.webp?t=1767105108\" width=25 height=25 /></span> BECOME THE FASTEST FROG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and sweet game based on the 2020 trend of dumb speedruns, like PetTheDog%.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669790/extras/d0ccb2984293e3c688ad6d1ab032c79c.webp?t=1767105108\" width=25 height=25 /></span>INTERACT WITH EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interaction in the game is a speedrun in itself, more than 50 routes possible, either by selecting objects or making them interact with one another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669790/extras/aff6d8ec4dea630e7cbe0b3c3acb6975.webp?t=1767105108\" width=50 height=50 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE WORLD OF SPEEDRUNNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal with this game is making this wonderful culture accessible to all, and hopefully motivating some in pursuing speedrun in other games, taking part in a larger community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669790/extras/b0cd7dc7c062b405a3d331c57cd64df1.webp?t=1767105108\" width=25 height=25 /></span> BECOME THE FASTEST FROG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and sweet game based on the 2020 trend of dumb speedruns, like PetTheDog%.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\